Date: Sat, 7 Nov 2026 19:58:02 +0100
Subject: [PATCH 12/18] Add includes that MSVC's precompiled headers provided

GCodeProcessor and utils use std::fstream, BlacklistedLibraryCheck uses
std::find and boost, Process wxFileName, BitmapCache and wxExtensions
wxDisplay, Notebook the sizers, WinRegistry std::vector, and wlanapi.h
needs windows.h first.
